cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "YAMS — Yet Another Modular Syntax"
message: "If you use this specification, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A YAML-based interchange format for modular dataflow graphs: named nodes
  connected by wires, each wire carrying a time-varying value. The format
  defines structure only — node types and their semantics come from a
  domain-specific catalog — making one serialization serve audio synthesis,
  control modulation, lighting, video routing, and signal-processing
  pipelines alike.
authors:
